[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:For Sale]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.60]Lesson 89 | 第89课
[00:02.99]For sale | 出售
[00:05.46]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.20]Why couldn't Nigel decide? | 奈杰尔为什么不能做决定?
[00:16.25]Good afternoon. | 下午好。
[00:18.36]I believe that this house is for sale. | 我相信这房子是要出售的。
[00:22.74]That's right. | 是的。
[00:24.53]May I have a look at it, please? | 请问我可以看看吗?
[00:27.99]Yes, of course. | 是的,当然可以。
[00:29.74]Come in. | 请进。
[00:31.65]How long have you lived here? | 您在这里住了多久?
[00:34.87]I've lived here for twenty years. | 我在这里住了二十年。
[00:38.28]Twenty years! | 二十年!
[00:40.47]That's a long time. | 那是很长一段时间。
[00:42.71]Yes, I've been here since 1976. | 是的,我从1976年就住在这儿。
[00:48.13]Then why do you want to sell it? | 那您为什么要卖掉它?
[00:51.82]Because I've just retired. | 因为我刚退休。
[00:54.68]I want to buy a small house in the country. | 我想在乡下买一个小房子。
[01:00.22]How much does this house cost? | 这房子多少钱?
[01:03.85]￡68, 500. | 68,500英镑。
[01:08.35]That's a lot of money! | 那可是一大笔钱!
[01:10.89]It's worth every penny of it. | 它值那个价。
[01:13.90]Well, I like the house, but I can't decide yet. | 嗯,我喜欢这房子,但我还没法做决定。
[01:20.43]My wife must see it first. | 我妻子必须先看看。
[01:23.76]Women always have the last word. | 女人总是有最后的决定权。